abstract: "Essay pipeline triangulating Jiang Xueqin's 2026 AI lecture, William Blake's Single Vision, and Friston's Active Inference as one failure mode: pathological prior dominance. Generates a full-length manuscript with its equations and light/dark figures from Python (uv, pytest, pandoc/xelatex)."
